This repository contains the draft manuscript of "AI in Finance: Finance for
Engineers, Scientists, and Data Scientists": the LaTeX sources and compiled PDFs
of the book, its companion Jupyter notebooks, technical notes, figures, data
files and supporting code.

No part of this repository may be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, or
used to create derivative works, in any form or by any means, without the prior
written permission of the author, except for brief quotations in reviews and as
otherwise permitted by applicable law (including fair dealing and fair use).

Readers may view the materials on GitHub, download a copy for their own
personal study, and run the companion notebooks on their own computers for that
purpose.

